If you're hearing this, you need to stop listening. Now.

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,000
That's my voice.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,500
That is my voice.

10
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:14,000
System check complete. Transmission is clean.

11
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:18,000
There's no error. There's no error.

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Oh god.

13
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:39,000
You were never the first, Aria.

14
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:43,000
You were never the only one.

15
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Welcome home.
